            "height": 134.39999999999998,
            "rotation": 0,
            "opacity": 1,
            "visible": true,
            "locked": false,
            "runs": [
              {
                "text": "表达与分发的边界",
                "style": {
                  "font_size": 48,
                  "color": "#f5f7fa",
                  "weight": 400,
                  "italic": false,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              }
            ],
            "claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "body-1-body",
            "order": 2,
            "type": "text",
            "x": 72,
            "y": 266.4,
            "width": 936,
            "height": 285.59999999999997,
            "rotation": 0,
            "opacity": 1,
            "visible": true,
            "locked": false,
            "runs": [
              {
                "text": "人设定义表达风格、专业领域、事实边界与价值取舍。账号持有发布权限、受众关系，处理平台格式与交互。\n\n若表达规则绑死在一个账号，换通道时便要重复配置；规则漂移会让各处声音不一致。",
                "style": {
                  "font_size": 34,
                  "color": "#f5f7fa",
                  "weight": 400,
                  "italic": false,
                  "align": "left"
                }
              }
            ],
            "claims": []
          }
        ],
        "role": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "body-2",
        "order": 2,
        "width": 1080,
